      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of obsolescence, and that feeling of being unseen is incredibly isolating. While the world is indeed changing, your expertise and the dedication you poured into your craft still hold inherent value, even if the medium has shifted. Perhaps there are new ways to apply that deep knowledge, like mentoring or consulting on the *principles* of your old craft. Don't let the pace of technology convince you that your entire life's work has become meaningless.",
